---
const { zh } = Astro.props;
---
    <!-- ===== DOCS ===== -->
    <div class="page" id="page-docs">
      <div class="hero animate-in" style="padding:2rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem">
        <h2>{zh ? "文档与使用指南" : "Documentation & Guides"}</h2>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">{zh ? "完整的中英文文档，每个能力都有详细的参数说明和示例" : "Full bilingual documentation with detailed parameters and examples for each capability"}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-row">
        <div class="stat-card animate-in"><div class="stat-value">117</div><div class="stat-label">{zh ? "能力文档（中/英）" : "Capability docs (zh/en)"}</div></div>
        <div class="stat-card animate-in"><div class="stat-value">32</div><div class="stat-label">{zh ? "分析领域" : "Analysis domains"}</div></div>
        <div class="stat-card animate-in"><div class="stat-value">40</div><div class="stat-label">{zh ? "分析技能 Skills" : "Skills"}</div></div>
        <div class="stat-card animate-in"><div class="stat-value">3</div><div class="stat-label">{zh ? "接入方式" : "Integration paths"}</div><div class="stat-unit">CLI · MCP · Rust</div></div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-title">{zh ? "文档分类" : "Document Categories"}</h2>
      <div class="doc-cats" id="doc-cats"></div>

      <div class="steps">
        <a class="step animate-in" href="https://github.com/Linxira-OS/linxira-bio-sdk/wiki" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">
          <div class="step-num" style="background:var(--accent-blue)">W</div>
          <div class="step-title">{zh ? "项目 Wiki" : "Project Wiki"}</div>
          <div class="step-desc">{zh ? "完整的使用手册、入门教程和常见问题" : "Full user manual, tutorials, and FAQ"}</div>
        </a>
        <a class="step animate-in" href="https://github.com/Linxira-OS/linxira-bio-sdk/tree/main/docs/capabilities" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">
          <div class="step-num" style="background:var(--accent-purple)">D</div>
          <div class="step-title">{zh ? "能力文档" : "Capability Docs"}</div>
          <div class="step-desc">{zh ? "每种分析能力的中英文参考文档（117 个能力）" : "Bilingual reference for each capability (117 capabilities)"}</div>
        </a>
        <a class="step animate-in" href="https://github.com/Linxira-OS/linxira-bio-sdk" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">
          <div class="step-num" style="background:var(--accent-green)">G</div>
          <div class="step-title">{zh ? "GitHub 仓库" : "GitHub Repo"}</div>
          <div class="step-desc">{zh ? "源代码、构建说明和贡献指南" : "Source code, build instructions, and contribution guide"}</div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-title">{zh ? "研究与报告" : "Research & Reports"}</h2>
      <p class="hero-subtitle" style="margin-bottom:1rem">{zh ? "已发布的实测报告，数据、环境与复现命令全部公开。" : "Published benchmark reports — data, environment and reproduction commands are all public."}</p>
      <div class="steps">
        <a class="step animate-in" href={`/${zh ? "zh" : "en"}/blog/bio-sdk-reproducibility-benchmark/`} style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">
          <div class="step-num" style="background:var(--accent-blue)">R</div>
          <div class="step-title">{zh ? "可复现性实测报告" : "Reproducibility Study"}</div>
          <div class="step-desc">{zh ? "Rust/Python/R 三后端一致性；对既有 salmon 管线逐位复现（TPM r = 1.000000）" : "Three-backend consistency; bit-for-bit reproduction of an existing salmon pipeline (TPM r = 1.000000)"}</div>
        </a>
        <a class="step animate-in" href={`/${zh ? "zh" : "en"}/blog/three-language-benchmark-2026-10-11/`} style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">
          <div class="step-num" style="background:var(--accent-purple)">B</div>
          <div class="step-title">{zh ? "三语言重复基准（N=10）" : "Three-Language Benchmark (N=10)"}</div>
          <div class="step-desc">{zh ? "同一批输入上 Rust / Biopython / Biostrings 各跑 10 次，8 项能力，预注册判定规则" : "Rust / Biopython / Biostrings, 10 runs each on identical inputs, 8 capabilities, pre-registered rules"}</div>
        </a>
        <a class="step animate-in" href={`/${zh ? "zh" : "en"}/blog/cloud-gpu-dual-vendor-validation/`} style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit">
          <div class="step-num" style="background:var(--accent-green)">G</div>
          <div class="step-title">{zh ? "云端双厂商 GPU 验证" : "Dual-Vendor GPU Validation"}</div>
          <div class="step-desc">{zh ? "NVIDIA 与摩尔线程两台上验证对接正确性：五类输出跨厂商逐字节一致" : "Docking correctness on NVIDIA and Moore Threads: five output classes byte-identical across vendors"}</div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
